#lang rhombus/scribble/manual

@title{Rhombus/HOL}

Rhombus/HOL is a theorem prover embedded in Rhombus as
@rhombuslangname(rhombus/hol): an LCF-style higher-order-logic kernel with an
ACL2-style automatic prover on top, where definitions are simultaneously
logical declarations and executable Rhombus code.

@italic{Under construction.}
